      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 4.53,
          "en": "Besides knowing which model to choose",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.53,
          "end": 6.6,
          "en": "there are more things you should be aware of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.6,
          "end": 10.29,
          "en": "when working with such APIs, especially when comparing it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.29,
          "end": 13.173,
          "en": "to the normal chatGPT website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.1,
          "end": 19.1,
          "en": "ChatGPT is all about processing information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.11,
          "end": 24.11,
          "en": "as chatGPT plus using the chatGPT APIs is not for free.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 25.74,
          "end": 28.74,
          "en": "To measure the amount of information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 28.74,
          "end": 33,
          "en": "that is processed and to indicate the amount",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 33,
          "end": 37.893,
          "en": "of information, chatGPT can keep as context within a chat,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 39.09,
          "end": 43.233,
          "en": "we can find the pricing based on so-called tokens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 44.1,
          "end": 46.44,
          "en": "This is the official pricing page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 46.44,
          "end": 48.78,
          "en": "Link is attached to this lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 48.78,
          "end": 51.24,
          "en": "And before we have a close look at the pricing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 51.24,
          "end": 54.39,
          "en": "at the point in time when we recorded the course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 54.39,
          "end": 57.033,
          "en": "we'll have a quick look at tokens first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 58.56,
          "end": 63.56,
          "en": "A token is the equivalent to roundabout 0.75 words",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 64.5,
          "end": 66.153,
          "en": "or four characters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 68.4,
          "end": 71.01,
          "en": "This refers to prompts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 71.01,
          "end": 74.97,
          "en": "So your messages you send to chatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 74.97,
          "end": 77.13,
          "en": "and the responses you get.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 77.13,
          "end": 79.77,
          "en": "So any kind of communication is measured",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 79.77,
          "end": 81.963,
          "en": "and tracked as tokens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 83.28,
          "end": 86.76,
          "en": "If you wanna have a rough idea about how such tokens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 86.76,
          "end": 90.96000000000001,
          "en": "are calculated, you can find the so-called tokenizer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 90.96000000000001,
          "end": 93.423,
          "en": "on the official OpenAI website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 94.65,
          "end": 96.9,
          "en": "In here you can now enter some texts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 96.9,
          "end": 101.583,
          "en": "so hello, how many tokens are these?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 102.57,
          "end": 106.71000000000001,
          "en": "And you see that we have 32 characters and 7 tokens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 106.71000000000001,
          "end": 107.97,
          "en": "in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 107.97,
          "end": 111.72,
          "en": "Now the way tokens are calculated, defer depending on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 111.72,
          "end": 114.03,
          "en": "the underlying model you're using.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 114.03,
          "end": 116.4,
          "en": "So depending on the underlying API.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 116.4,
          "end": 119.88,
          "en": "But this website is not too bad for a rough estimate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 119.88,
          "end": 124.173,
          "en": "to get a first idea about the way tokens are calculated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 125.55,
          "end": 128.91,
          "en": "Now, if we look at the models that we selected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 128.91,
          "end": 132.27,
          "en": "as the, well, most useful ones when getting started",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 132.27,
          "end": 136.38,
          "en": "with the API, we see different amounts of tokens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 136.38,
          "end": 140.55,
          "en": "these models can process so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 140.55,
          "end": 143.82,
          "en": "We have round about 8,000 for GPT-4,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 143.82,
          "end": 146.607,
          "en": "round about 32,000 for GPT-4 32k,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 148.16,
          "end": 153.16,
          "en": "and we have round about 4,000 for the 3.5 turbo API model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 153.72,
          "end": 158.57999999999998,
          "en": "Now these tokens are not something like a limit for messages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 158.57999999999998,
          "end": 160.95,
          "en": "or output or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 160.95,
          "end": 164.76,
          "en": "These token limits simply define the context limit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 164.76,
          "end": 167.07,
          "en": "for prompts and answers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 167.07,
          "end": 171.3,
          "en": "So if you build a website with an ongoing chat,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 171.3,
          "end": 175.56,
          "en": "after 8,000 tokens for the GPT-4 model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 175.56,
          "end": 178.89,
          "en": "chatGPT or the API will lose the context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 178.89,
          "end": 183.42,
          "en": "for any topics discussed beyond this limit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 183.42,
          "end": 186.77,
          "en": "So if the conversation started at zero and now we have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 186.77,
          "end": 191.55,
          "en": "10,000 tokens, the first 2000 tokens will not be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 191.55,
          "end": 194.853,
          "en": "in memory anymore of the GPT model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 195.99,
          "end": 199.02,
          "en": "This limit includes prompts and answers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 199.02,
          "end": 204.02,
          "en": "So chatGPT will forget, so to say both earlier prompts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 204.54,
          "end": 206.463,
          "en": "and earlier outputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 207.36,
          "end": 209.28,
          "en": "So this is why you should understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 209.28,
          "end": 212.07,
          "en": "the basics behind tokens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 212.07,
          "end": 215.34,
          "en": "Another important aspect is the one I mentioned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 215.34,
          "end": 217.17000000000002,
          "en": "at the beginning of this lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 217.17000000000002,
          "end": 222.17000000000002,
          "en": "The pricing of using the APIs is also based on tokens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 223.53,
          "end": 226.41,
          "en": "The pricing page is attached to this lecture",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 226.41,
          "end": 229.38,
          "en": "and it will probably change when you are watching this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 229.38,
          "end": 232.47,
          "en": "But as said, when we recorded the course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 232.47,
          "end": 235.503,
          "en": "this is the pricing for the different models used.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 236.46,
          "end": 239.13,
          "en": "For the default GPT-4 model so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 239.13,
          "end": 242.43,
          "en": "we have 3 cents for 1000 tokens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 242.43,
          "end": 246.75,
          "en": "for the prompt and 6 cents for the completion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 246.75,
          "end": 250.35,
          "en": "So this is the prompt and this is the output so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 250.35,
          "end": 254.31,
          "en": "For the 32K context pricing is significantly higher",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 254.31,
          "end": 256.32,
          "en": "and for the 3.5 turbo model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 256.32,
          "end": 259.02,
          "en": "the pricing is significantly lower.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 259.02,
          "end": 263.25,
          "en": "With that token logic in mind and with this page in mind,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 263.25,
          "end": 267.33,
          "en": "you can get a rough estimate about how much you have to pay",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 267.33,
          "end": 271.53,
          "en": "to use the chatGPT API endpoints.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 271.53,
          "end": 275.07,
          "en": "So we are now ready to build our first very basic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
